From: Christian Jaeger <ch@christianjaeger.ch>
Date: Wed, 22 Nov 2023 01:54:45 +0100
Subject: .bashrc: [PATCH 167/191] .bashrc: add `ul`

Not sure I'll ever use this, though.
---
 .bashrc | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/.bashrc b/.bashrc
index 658fc95..53d22d3 100644
--- a/.bashrc
+++ b/.bashrc
@@ -96,6 +96,7 @@ uu () { _cd_then ../.. "$@"; }
 uuu () { _cd_then ../../.. "$@"; }
 uuuu () { _cd_then ../../../.. "$@"; }
 uuuuu () { _cd_then ../../../../.. "$@"; }
+ul () { cd ..;  l "$@"; }
 les () { less "$@"; }
 c () { cd "$@"; }
 cdnewdir () {
